"""
FastDeploy backup/restore runner for Echoport.

Service-owned same-host script for FastDeploy:
- Backup: PostgreSQL dump + service/runners/config/system files, manifest,
  tarball upload to MinIO.
- Restore: Download + checksum verify, safe extract, validation, disk precheck,
  safety snapshot, stop writers, restore files/db, health check, rollback.
"""

